From `~/GitHub/_home`:

```
python3 -I .agents/skills/write-findings/check_findings.py <page.md> \
    --quotes ~/GitHub/_research/<niche>/quotes [--evidence <evidence file>]...
```

`--evidence` turns on the coverage check and may be given several times; use it for
findings pages, not for `her-words.md`.
A phrase taken from another niche's quotes needs that niche's `quotes` folder as a second
`--quotes`.

